        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:258.00054931640625,782.1856079101562,1743.1088256835938,2428.8324584960938",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p><i>Registration mark on left</i></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Let it be registered in the office of accounts,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">if God wills.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They have registered the amount of a third and an eighth.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God for his bounties.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb for the sum owed through his standing surety for the estates in the town of al-Fayy\u016bm for the year four-hundred and four,\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">under the supervision of the auspicious, rightly-guided judge, \u1e6eiqat al-Mulk Mak\u012bn al-Dawla wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuh\u0101,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the prot\u00e9g\u00e9 of the commander of the faithful, \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAl\u012b ibn Bah\u0101r, with \u02beAb\u016b al-Sar\u012b\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Theodor ibn Yu\u1e25annis acting as accountant.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Half of this: A sixth and a sixteenth. Its amount: A third and an eighth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101'\u012bl ibn \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25, the cashier. Valid. The eighth of Rab\u012b\u02bf II</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the year four-hundred and four.\u00a0</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
